    <briefdescription>
<para>Runs a command once for each epoch and collects its samples. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Each epoch runs the command and reads the samples file that the command writes. When the manifest has a <computeroutput>## sample</computeroutput> table, each epoch also runs a <ref refid="class_sampler" kindref="compound">Sampler</ref>. The object keeps one set of data for each table type: the table type of the samples file, <computeroutput>sample</computeroutput> and <computeroutput>cswitch</computeroutput>. For each table type it keeps the epoch samples, the calls, the units and the merged bins of each row. The <computeroutput>epoch</computeroutput>, <computeroutput>user</computeroutput> and <computeroutput>system</computeroutput> rows belong to the table type of the samples file. <computeroutput><ref refid="class_benchmark_1ac2758e9667d09cca4fa1c7d0845c7413" kindref="member">getProfiles</ref></computeroutput> builds the profiles from them. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
